  "findings": [
    "Inventory root getEffectiveCapacity(actor) delegates to native capacity; getMaxWeight on a character-owned container delegates to character comfortable weight. Normal mode preserves the existing allowance policy.",
    "ItemContainer.hasRoomFor(actor,item) retains vehicle/heavy-item, item restriction, bag maximum-item, parent/nested and native effective-capacity checks. Unequipped item weight participates in native admission. Special 50-unit checks for vehicle seats/floor are not a universal hard-cap API.",
    "Native getEffectiveCapacity ignores Organized/Disorganized modification for a character-owned root; other storage may receive native capacity modifiers. Actual native capacity is queried rather than hardcoding 50.",
    "IsoObject.setOverlaySprite(String,FFFF,Z) includes server/client packet dispatch when its boolean permits it. The isolated remote-client candidate supplies false and is not installed as a global update hook.",
    "WorldFiller.lua lines 26-27 define native overlays for furniture_shelving_01_0/1. Candidate assets are original; their atlas/geometry/renderer alignment remains unverified.",
    "WorldItemModelDrawer.renderMain requires an InventoryItem and native render context. No WorldItemModelDrawer class reference was found in LuaManager$Exposer.class; this is a negative research finding, not proof that every possible binding is absent. Safe Lua visual-only attachment lifecycle UNKNOWN.",
    "OnContainerUpdate in ISInventoryPage.lua lines 2152-2155 is documented for objects added/removed; it is not proof that every contents mutation or chunk unload emits a complete authoritative revision event.",
    "Base.Notebook, Base.SheetPaper2, Base.Pen and Base.Pencil are verified native types. Disc_Retail uses MediaCategory CDs, Icon Disc and WorldStaticModel Disk. Mov_DesktopComputer references appliances_com_01_72; this does not prove a functional native terminal interface.",
    "CraftRecipeData.luaCallOnCreate(actor) calls a Lua callback with (data, actor) via protectedCallVoid; CraftRecipe.OnTestItem calls (item, actor). An OnCreate return cannot veto a completed mutation. Native input consumption/output/snapshot commit and recovery need a separate verified adapter before activating ledger burning.",
    "NetTimedAction.getDuration uses adjusted duration with a 20ms conversion; the prototype stores proposed seconds only and does not activate native writing time or claim measured timing."
  ]
}
